{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-10-12T02:14:36.179382Z", "id": "github:release:712225112:release:409941220", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 2883, "prerelease": false, "stars": 30043, "stars_delta": 5, "tag_name": "v1.4.4"}, "organization": "Genesis-Embodied-AI", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-10-11T21:53:18Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "712225112:release:409941220", "summary": "The minor release speeds up rigid body simulation on GPU while significantly improving the robustness of perturbation-based multi-contact without extra runtime cost.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1034\" height=\"561\" alt=\"contact_showcase\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88774a4c-e45a-44e4-855b-c909de036e59\" />\r\n\r\n### New Features\r\n\r\n* Let heterogeneous entities differ in scale, fixed base pose and joint parameters. (@duburcqa) (#3497)\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* Fix convex contact depth, normal and placement errors. (@duburcqa) (#3512, #3513, #3518, #3520, #3521)\r\n* Fix convex collision detection edge-cases. (@duburcqa) (#3472, #3504, #3514, #3517)\r\n* Fix non-deterministic GPU simulations. (@duburcqa) (#3510)\r\n* Fix alpha cutout of masked glTF material. (@kevin9327) (#3341)\r\n* Fix named terrain cache invalidation when its subterrain parameters change. (@MohammadHijjawi97) (#3456)\r\n* Fix contact markers frozen in place after a scene reset. (@duburcqa) (#3493)\r\n\r\n### Miscellaneous\r\n\r\n* Speed up rigid body simulation on GPU. (@duburcqa) (#3458, #3459, #3462, #3470)\r\n* Reduce the memory footprint of heterogeneous entities. (@duburcqa) (#3488)\r\n* Allow fast prototyping by dramatically reducing kernel recompilation. (@duburcqa) (#3464)\r\n* Bound the number of rigid solver compilations across scenes of different sizes. (@duburcqa) (#3461)\r\n* Support recording numpy scalars to files. (@MohammadHijjawi97) (#3457)\r\n* Migrate from deprecated TorchScript to torch.compile. (@duburcqa) (#3479)\r\n* Show the changes made by setters in the interactive viewer right away. (@duburcqa) (#3494)", "title": "Genesis-Embodied-AI/genesis-world v1.4.4", "topics": ["embodied_vision"], "updated_at": "2026-10-11T21:57:07Z", "url": "https://github.com/Genesis-Embodied-AI/genesis-world/releases/tag/v1.4.4", "venue": null}
