{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-10-12T02:14:36.179382Z", "id": "github:release:871368615:release:409588695", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 740, "prerelease": false, "stars": 9249, "stars_delta": 3, "tag_name": "streamrender-h3-examples-v1"}, "organization": "NVlabs", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-10-11T10:14:51Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "871368615:release:409588695", "summary": "# StreamRender-H3 curated racing examples\n\n60 reference-video render requests: 20 scenes in group A and 10 trajectories\nwith four appearance variants each in group B. Default: B10_e-track-3_bluehour.\n\nThe archive contains 30 semantic videos and 60 reference pictures, plus a\nSHA-256 inventory. Extract it from models/streamrender_h3 to populate\nexamples/media/. Request JSONLs and usage instructions are in the sol-engine\nbranch under models/streamrender_h3/examples/.\n\nCheckpoint download: https://huggingface.co/yitongl/StreamRender-H3\n\nUsage: https://github.com/NVlabs/Sana/tree/sol-engine/models/streamrender_h3/examples\n\nThese are prerecorded input examples, not generated output videos or action\ntranscripts. Contributor permission covers publication of this material;\nupstream model and third-party game asset licenses remain applicable.\n", "title": "NVlabs/Sana StreamRender-H3 curated racing examples", "topics": ["efficient_vision_models", "quantization", "super_resolution"], "updated_at": "2026-10-11T10:14:51Z", "url": "https://github.com/NVlabs/Sana/releases/tag/streamrender-h3-examples-v1", "venue": null}
